Z||000000||dogtired||03-17-2000||06:55 AM||||This is probably one of the hardest posts I have ever written!<BR>You Fiero Forum Folks have been so good (GREAT) to me, I just don't know where to start THANKING YOU!<BR>I have recieved so many notes and cards from Forum friends I just don't know where to start.<BR>THANK YOU!<BR>THANK YOU!<BR>THANK YOU!<BR>I have never been one to say THANK YOU very often, but in this case I just can't say it enough!<BR>If I tried to list everyone by name, I am sure I would leave some one out ( getting OLD, the mind is the second thing to go?    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  ), and I wouldn't want that.<BR>It really does make recovery easier when you have a bunch of special friends out there.<BR>Laying flat on my back gives one lots of time to think about life and all that is going on and ones priorities. I still am in lots of pain and taking more drugs (prescriptions) than anyone should have too, but I am on the mend and should be back in no time.<BR>I see I have a lot of reading to try and catch up with all that is going on here, and will try to get back in the swing of thing as quicky as possible.<BR>Even though I was down for awhile, I have  acquired another couple cars and car related activities that are almost un believeable ( will get into that later).<P>I do have to pass on a couple SPECIAL  THANKS. <BR>My daughter (yes the one in the photo)   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> for putting up with this old man.<BR>Cliff, for taking all his time to keep this Forum running and still having time to send members notes when they are down, Cliff you are the MAN.<BR>The BIGGEST THANKS to  a TRUE FRIEND, Monkeyman  just for being there and helping me through this episode of my life. You know how special you are to me and the FORUM.<BR>You Folks are the best, I better get to reading the posts or I will never get caught up.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"><BR>Again<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>THANKS<BR>THANKS<BR>THANKS<BR>Your FIERO Friend    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||6
