Z||000013||turbo86se||03-17-2000||08:29 PM||||dogtired, glad you're back and I really hope everything works out for you. This is giving me hope b/c my grandmother, Lula, has been in and out of the hospital for a month now. Her lower back is causing her so much pain she can barely walk. Lula's been given several MRI's and they've found no cancer. Doctors don't know what's wrong with her. Several of my family members are doctors, and they don't know either, except to get a second and third opinion. Anyways, I'm glad to have you back. <P>Ok, I've been following this thread and several others for a while, everyone keeps refering your daughter as the one in the picture! Did I miss something? She must be real cute!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">   Any chance we could meet?  LOL  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
